IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0046.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    05 J-TN               PIC 9(2).
    05 AI-AMT             PIC 9(7)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 ML-AMT             PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2000-LOAN-MULTIPLE
    DISPLAY "ML-AMT=" ML-AMT
    STOP RUN.
2000-LOAN-MULTIPLE.
    IF J-TN >= 7
        COMPUTE ML-AMT = AI-AMT * 5
    ELSE
        IF J-TN >= 3
            COMPUTE ML-AMT = AI-AMT * 3
        ELSE
            COMPUTE ML-AMT ROUNDED = AI-AMT * 1.5
        END-IF
    END-IF.
